            "review_title": "Review at Ciao Bella Thao Dien",
            "review_text": "Rio\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nthe worse Italian experience in Saigon\nAug 2022 • Family\nI ve been living in this area for three years and I ve never been in this Ciao Bella restaurant because I ve heard it was nothing special and as an Italian national I kept distance from it.\nTonight for a serious of events we decided to go and try it and I swear I ve never thought it would be so BAD !!!\nWe ordered three dishes and all of them was disgusting, the starter “involtini di melanzana” was basically frozen and warmed up in a microwave; you understand that when the plait is super HOT and it look more like a Lasagna than a involtini di melanzana.\nThe ravioli frozen too with a heavy unknown cream.\nThe last dish salmon was not fresh for sure and smashed potatoes all around with some spinach made the all dish super heavy I felt like I was eating concrete my stomach felt so heavy !!\nEnd of the story the food in this restaurant is crap and is a proper rip off !!!\nThey welcome you with some cheap sparkling wine and some bread with oil and tomatoes just to impress you because they know that they gonna serve you CRAP \nIt was an orribile dinner we payed 800.000 Dong I felt like I throwed this amount in the rubbish been !!!!\nSimply Cheating Customers \nA shame for the real Italian food \nPlease never never go there stay at home !!!\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 20, 2022",
