            "review_text": "DavidAlves\nInveresk, near Edinburgh Scotland90 contributions\n0\nEar-bursting experience!\nDec 2016\nThis must be the noisiest restaurant I've ever been in! An adjoining Birthday party made the most of the tiled floors and exposed brick walls to maximise their impact. Pleasant enough meal lifted by the best Tiramisu served in the biggest portion I've ever tasted.Good service! Watch out if you have trouble with stairs as one of our party had a heart attack and bypass in March and had to struggle up three floors.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 20, 2016",
